Package: allseer
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: libc6, libelf1t64 | libelf1, zlib1g, libzstd1
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/stringNameMahin/ALLSEER
Description: governance runtime for AI coding agents
 ALLSEER derives an execution envelope from the task an AI coding agent is
 given, observes the agent with eBPF, and records, asks about or stops what
 falls outside that envelope.
